title: Guardian
---
<<declare $treated_guardian = false>>
<<declare $gifted_guardian = false>>
<<declare $gift_1 = "">>
<<declare $gift_2 = "">>
<<declare $gift_3 = "">>
<<declare $guardian_wants = "">>
<<if not $treated_guardian>>
    <<jump GuardianFirstBrew>>
<<endif>>
Guardian: Thank you for tending to me, Aruna.
-> Chat
    Guardian: ...
-> Offer Concoction
    <<jump OfferConcoction>>
-> Bye
===

title: GuardianFirstBrew
---
<<if not $gifted_guardian>>
    Guardian: Aruna. The cure for what ails me eludes me, and every day I am weaker.
    Guardian: Could you prepare these herbs to ease my symptoms?
    <<give_guardian_herbs>>
    <<set $gifted_guardian to true>>
    (You receive 1 {$gift_1}, 1 {$gift_2} and 1 {$gift_3}. Drag them to the empty slots to brew.)
<<else>>
    Guardian: The herbs, Aruna. Please.
<<endif>>
<<offer_concoction>>
<<if $treated_guardian>>
    Guardian: That helps. But it's no cure.
    Guardian: Outdoors to the right are some more herbs. Can you find something to {$guardian_wants}?
<<else>>
    Guardian: Please, Aruna. I won't last long like this.
<<endif>>
===

title: LeaveBeforeTending
---
It would be rude to leave before tending to your guest.
===

